bolt pretension load.</NPR><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/></NTE>
<BRK/>
<TXT><RID>ASTM F959/F959M</RID>, hot dip galvanized steel.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
]</SPT><SPT><TTL>Stainless Steel</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<SPT><TTL>Bolts</TTL><BRK/>
