<BRK/>
<TXT><RID>ASTM A123/A123M</RID> or <RID>ASTM A153/A153M</RID>, as applicable, unless specified otherwise.  GALVANIZED SURFACES SHALL NOT BE "PASSIVATED" OR "STABILIZED".</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<SPT><TTL>Galvanizing Repair Compound</TTL><BRK/>
