         </CEL>
      </ROW>
      <ROW AUTOHEIGHT="0" HEIGHT="45.75">
         <CEL MERGEACROSS="6">
<DTA TYPE="STRING">The viscosity of the admixed coating, when tested in accordance with <RID>ASTM D1200</RID> through a No. 4 Ford cup, shall be as follows:</DTA>
         </CEL>
      </ROW>
